  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Of the running I kept nothing. Trees, and the shock of hitting them.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 4.62
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Everything I could not see was them, and it was all around me.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 7.0,
      "seconds": 4.5
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Somewhere above, I was sure, that blade of heat was still turning.",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 12.625,
      "seconds": 5.11
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "At last I could go no further, and I fell by the wayside.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 20.958,
      "seconds": 4.03
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then the ground had me, and I stayed on it a long while.",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 26.917,
      "seconds": 4.11
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Did that happen? Did any of that happen?",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 32.167,
      "seconds": 2.62
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Somewhere behind me was my hat. My collar had torn off its stud.",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 37.292,
      "seconds": 5.17
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The fear came off me like a garment, and I was a citizen again.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 45.0,
      "seconds": 4.86
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The heath, the quiet, the flames going up: a dream I had just left.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 51.0,
      "seconds": 5.22
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A head rose over the arch, and a workman with a basket came by.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 57.333,
      "seconds": 4.56
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "He wished me good night. I made a noise at him and walked on.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 63.0,
      "seconds": 4.28
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Over the Maybury arch a train went flying south, and it had gone.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 69.583,
      "seconds": 4.72
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "All of it ordinary, all of it certain. And two miles back, that.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 75.417,
      "seconds": 5.46
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Three of them stood talking at a front gate, and I stopped there.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 83.0,
      "seconds": 3.84
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "What news from the common?",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 87.958,
      "seconds": 2.17
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_neighbour",
      "text": "Ain't yer just been there?",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 93.042,
      "seconds": 1.87
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_neighbours_wife",
      "text": "People seem fair silly about the common. What's it all about?",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 97.833,
      "seconds": 4.5
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Haven't you heard of the men from Mars, I said. The creatures from Mars.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 103.458,
      "seconds": 5.14
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "You'll hear more yet.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 110.708,
      "seconds": 1.62
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I felt foolish, and went on home.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 113.028,
      "seconds": 2.92
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "My wife opened the door. She stepped back from the look of me.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 118.25,
      "seconds": 4.03
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The collar had gone at the stud. I never felt it go.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 123.417,
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I went in, sat down, drank some wine, and told her what I had seen.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 131.75,
      "seconds": 5.2
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Nothing alive has ever moved so slowly, I told her. They barely crawl.",
      "shot": 23,
      "at": 138.083,
      "seconds": 5.98
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "They may keep the pit, but they cannot get out of it.",
      "shot": 24,
      "at": 147.0,
      "seconds": 3.28
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I laid stress on the weight of them here, and overlooked two things.",
      "shot": 25,
      "at": 152.208,
      "seconds": 3.98
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "narrators_wife",
      "text": "They may come here.",
      "shot": 26,
      "at": 158.5,
      "seconds": 1.37
    }
  ]
}